<http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/AIR/SSA> a owl:Class ;
	skos:prefLabel """SS-A antibody, immunodiffusion or other method"""@en ;
	skos:notation """SSA"""^^xsd:string ;
	skos:definition """SS-A Antibody: an antibody to a nucleoprotein that is also called Ro. It is less specific for Sjogren's syndrome than SS-B and can be seen in SLE and other diseases. It is often found in patients with subacute cutaneous lupus erythematosus and is associated with neonatal lupus heart block."""@en ;
