<http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/AIR/THEMG> a owl:Class ;
	skos:prefLabel """Abnormal EMG, thenar or other hand muscles"""@en ;
	skos:notation """THEMG"""^^xsd:string ;
	skos:definition """Abnormal EMG, thenar and other hand muscles: This finding is used in Carpal Tunnel Syndrome (CTS). Severe CTS will result in findings of denervation of the muscle on EMG. These findings include spontaneous biphasic potentials, polyphasic potentials of large amplitude and long duration, decreased number of motor units, positive sharp waves and fibrilation potentials."""@en ;
