<http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/AIR/FBSNV> a owl:Class ;
	skos:prefLabel """Synovial biopsy: foreign body synovitis"""@en ;
	skos:notation """FBSNV"""^^xsd:string ;
	skos:definition """Synovial biopsy, foreign body synovitis: In patients with silicone joint prostheses, a reactive synovitis in response to silicone particles may develop. This synovitis is seen more frequently with wrist implants than with MCP implants, perhaps due to the greater compressive loading of the wrist. Plant matter can also set up a reactive synovitis."""@en ;
